# Learning Projects

Overview
This repository is used to collect learning projects, notes, and small experiments. The README was previously undefined — this file provides a minimal structure and a place to record short, verifiable daily progress.

Goals
- Keep a clear, minimal record of what I'm learning and working on.
- Make it easy to see the most recent meaningful changes.
- Provide simple guidance for future updates.

